# Written by `flux init` (ADR 0006), then edited for this repo. Runtime state is
# rebuildable; artifacts are not.
#
# `state/` is deliberately NOT ignored here, unlike the flux init default. flux's own
# repo is also the project record, and a ticket's checkpoints are part of what a run
# left behind. Consequence to know about: `flux.git.stage_commit` does `git add -A`, so
# checkpoints written during a run are swept into that stage's own commit. `flux init`
# will not restore the default over this file — it warns instead.
transcripts/
usage/
cache/
